Documentation directory
=======================

User documentation:
- README.api.en.md: English API reference.
- README.api.zh_cn.md: Simplified Chinese API reference.
- imgs/: output screenshots linked from the project README.

Project conventions and planning:
- README.commit.md and SPEC.commit.md: commit conventions.
- README.gitflow.md: branching workflow.
- README.release.md: versioning conventions.
- SPEC.blog.md: writing conventions.
- TODO.txt: development roadmap, not part of the Universe submission.

License copies:
- LICENSE: project license copy with its copyright notice.
- LICENSE.apache: Apache License 2.0 reference text.
- ../LICENSE: the license distributed with the package.

The user documentation and screenshots are retained in the Universe submission
for links from README.md. The manifest excludes /doc/ from compiler downloads.
Development-only documents need not be copied into the Universe submission.
